$Comments
Two tetrahedra that share a face on the plane x + y = 31200 cm, from a Gmsh mesh of the
urban source example in OpenSnExamples. Element 1 (physical 2) lies on the side x + y < 31200
and element 2 (physical 1) on the side x + y > 31200. Used by MeshTest.PointOnSharedFace.
